  "dropped": [
    "Primary inferior STEMI without aortic pathology (no fallback reperfusion plan if CT excludes dissection)",
    "RV infarction caution when using vasodilators (the earlier V4R/nitrate warning was not carried into the GTN/nitroprusside advice)"
